{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（21日）下午，警方接獲《香港01》職員報案，指於葵涌貨櫃碼頭路88號永得利廣場辦公室拆信時，發現有信件藏有粉末，於是報警。</p><p>警員到場調查，並疏散一批職員，其後消防員及警方爆炸品處理課（EOD）人員亦到場，EOD人員檢走一個膠箱，懷疑裝著與案有關物品。</p><p>事故原因及詳情有待調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T09:42:05.762139+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:39:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T16:57:43.259053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:37:42.837787+00:00","content_hash":"e3bcbd84138ee6eb8f040d4e52dd9eb8c92a17517d7143c900dd40a2bc41dcd1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}